OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny with three hours
OL,6,     Gof classical music to reflect,
OL,7,     Grestore and refresh, whether
OL,8,     Gyou're hunkering down with a book
OL,9,     Gor heading for a walk in the
OL,10,     Ghills.
OL,11,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,12,     GTV presenter Peter Purves shares
OL,13,     Ghis musical passions with Michael
OL,14,     GBerkeley, and talks about his
OL,15,     Gcareer on Blue Peter, Doctor Who
OL,16,     Gand Crufts.
OL,17,G1330FMusic Map
OL,18,     GBruch's Violin Concerto No.1 is
OL,19,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch's destination
OL,20,     Gon today's Music Map. Along with
OL,21,     Gway, she travels via Bach,
OL,22,     GStravinsky and Stephane Grappelli.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
