OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom St Lawrence Church, York,
OL,6,     Gwith the Ebor Singers, with music
OL,7,     Gby Richard Allain, Lucy Walker,
OL,8,     GBairstow and Buxtehude.
OL,9,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,10,     GJoin our community of jazz
OL,11,     Glovers. Alyn Shipton is waiting
OL,12,     Gfor your requests: email
OL,13,     Gjrr@bbc.co.uk or use
OL,14,     G_jazzrecordrequests on social.
OL,15,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,16,     GHannah French presents a concert
OL,17,     Ggiven in Lisbon by Hesperion XXI,
OL,18,     Gdirected by Jordi Savall,
OL,19,     Gfeaturing consort music by
OL,20,     Gcomposers such as Dowland,
OL,21,     GPurcell, Bach, Ferrabosco & Lawes.
